fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#GstAppSinkSimpleCallbacks","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSinkSimpleCallbacks\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkSimpleCallbacks\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkSimpleCallbacks\n\nA set of callbacks that can be installed on the appsink with\ngst_app_sink_set_simple_callbacks.\nUnlike GstAppSinkCallbacks this can also be used from bindings.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nA set of callbacks that can be installed on the appsink with\nGstApp.AppSink.prototype.set_simple_callbacks.\nUnlike GstAppSinkCallbacks this can also be used from bindings.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nA set of callbacks that can be installed on the appsink with\nGstApp.AppSink.set_simple_callbacks.\nUnlike GstAppSinkCallbacks this can also be used from bindings.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});